{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "rhsca9ogwzrst6vf", "title": "129.Dify基于工作流搭建社媒分析助手", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"xz5yU\" id=\"xz5yU\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1929f70a\" id=\"u1929f70a\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">课程内容</span></h2><ol list=\"u8f22de5e\"><li fid=\"u308e03ac\" data-lake-id=\"udd62964b\" id=\"udd62964b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u074b580c\" id=\"u074b580c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 65, 70)\">ChatFlow 的基础知识</span></li><li fid=\"u308e03ac\" data-lake-id=\"u67f25b0e\" id=\"u67f25b0e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f595fde\" id=\"u5f595fde\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 65, 70)\">如何在 Dify 中避免明文密钥</span></li><li fid=\"u308e03ac\" data-lake-id=\"u8a696866\" id=\"u8a696866\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b5ab129\" id=\"u6b5ab129\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 65, 70)\">HTTP 工具的使用</span></li><li fid=\"u308e03ac\" data-lake-id=\"u3ce0d1e8\" id=\"u3ce0d1e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1844daf0\" id=\"u1844daf0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 65, 70)\">社媒文章分析助手搭建</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B\" id=\"%E7%AE%80%E4%BB%8B\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08007dd9\" id=\"u08007dd9\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-headings)\">简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u17d81663\" id=\"u17d81663\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7b90d35\" id=\"ua7b90d35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 65, 70)\">Dify 内置 HTTP 工具，我们可以通过发送 HTTP 请求来调用外部爬虫工具，实现社媒文章分析、文案改写</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u44974001\" id=\"u44974001\"><span data-lake-id=\"u02a014fe\" id=\"u02a014fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 65, 70)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u637afd1b\" id=\"u637afd1b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc6211b50\" id=\"uc6211b50\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 65, 70)\">效果展示</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0d928e69\" id=\"u0d928e69\"><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/DeepSeek-R1\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucef721f0\" id=\"ucef721f0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u437de564\" id=\"u437de564\">https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/DeepSeek-R1</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5000de48\" id=\"u5000de48\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1748354994781-eab0519a-313a-49c8-a68b-ed1767b43bfe.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufeb1dc61-c159-419c-bb1c-e87b99cee8b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u23af8eec-60d8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A451.0145176881717%2C%22height%22%3A623%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22fabf20c5ba2a78e2e042da81f33cd72e_1748317085377-6810217f-bda1-49a8-a8fe-97aec1650352_x-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A226217%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A778%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1075%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.7249999046325684%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%87%86%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1.%E8%AF%A5%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%9C%A8%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A604%2C%22width%22%3A538%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK-R1%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%BE%E5%85%88%E8%BF%9B%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E6%90%9C%E7%B4%A2%22%2C%22x%22%3A166%2C%22y%22%3A514%2C%22width%22%3A526%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%92%8C%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%84%E6%A8%A1%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E9%9B%86%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%A2%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%E5%8D%93%E8%B6%8A%2C%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%A4%9A%E7%A7%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A166%2C%22y%22%3A648%2C%22width%22%3A541%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DEEPSEEK-R1%E7%94%B1XYZ%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E7%A0%94%E5%8F%91%2C%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88%E4%BA%86%E6%9C%80%22%